1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The truth about caffeine. How many of you here consider yourself caffeine addicts? How

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
much coffee do you drink in a day? One cup? Two cups? More? How about caffeinated sodas?

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,920
Caffeine is pervasive in our society these days and every few months we hear about how

4
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:28,480
a study has shown that it is bad for us or good for us. What are we to believe? Today

5
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:33,840
I'd like to give you some of the facts about caffeine and its effects on your body. I

6
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:39,040
may not cause you to change your coffee consumption, but at least you'll be better informed about

7
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:44,680
what you are putting into your body. I'm going to talk about the beneficial effects of caffeine,

8
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:51,880
the negative effects, and discuss what are considered to be safe levels of caffeine consumption.

9
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:57,160
Let's start with the good news. Caffeine, which comes from the leaves, seeds and fruits

10
00:00:57,160 --> 00:01:03,400
of about 63 different plants, is well known as a stimulant. That's why people drink it, right?

11
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:10,120
Caffeine does help you wake up and feel more alert, and it has been shown to increase attention

12
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:16,280
spans. This is a beneficial effect for people who are driving long distances and for people

13
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:22,960
who are doing tedious work. Calling this a health benefit may be stretching it, though staying awake

14
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:28,600
while you are driving a car definitely contributes to your well-being. Caffeine also contains

15
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:35,200
antioxidants which have been shown to have cancer prevention qualities. The negative effects of

16
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:41,880
caffeine are largely dependent on how much you consume. When consumed in small quantities,

17
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:48,640
for example when you have one cup of coffee or one soda, caffeine can increase your heart rate,

18
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:55,120
cause you to urinate more, which can cause dehydration, and prompt your digestive system

19
00:01:55,120 --> 00:02:01,760
to produce more acid. In larger amounts, caffeine can cause you to have headaches, feel restless

20
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:08,760
and nervous, be unable to sleep, and even in very large quantities to have hallucinations.

21
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:15,680
Don't try that at home. When larger amounts of caffeine, over 600 milligrams per day, are

22
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:22,200
ingested over long periods of time, they can cause sleep problems, depression, and digestion issues.

23
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:29,240
According to a Medline article on the National Institutes of Health website, having caffeine in

24
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:35,880
your diet is not of any benefit to your health, but by the same token, moderate consumption is

25
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:42,200
not considered harmful. They say that having up to three eight ounce cups of coffee a day,

26
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:52,080
or 250 milligrams of caffeine, is considered, quote, average or moderate. Ten cups of coffee a day is

27
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:59,120
considered excessive. Also, remember that the amount of caffeine per cup can vary greatly,

28
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:06,480
depending on the type of beans that are used and the strength of the brew. Most sodas with caffeine,

29
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:13,120
unless they are specially enhanced, have about 35 milligrams of caffeine per eight ounces.

30
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:19,840
This means that you don't have to worry too much unless you are drinking several two litre bottles

31
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:27,200
per day. Also, the effect of the caffeine on you personally will depend on a number of factors,

32
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:33,600
such as your weight, general health, mood, and personal sensitivity to caffeine.

33
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:40,400
As you can see, caffeine can have both positive and negative effects on our health and wellbeing.

34
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:46,560
Nevertheless, the bottom line is that if you drink your coffee or sodas in moderation,

35
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:51,840
you don't have to worry too much. So the next time you are wondering whether or not you should

36
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:58,160
have that second cup of coffee to perk you up, relax. At least now you know what it will and

37
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:00,720
won't do for you.

